{#
  The seat control (body-hub proposal, approved 3 October 2026): a row of buttons,
  one per seat, that filters every list of the body's page to one seat. Built once
  for every body with seats: the school districts' trustee areas, the City's
  council districts, SCV Water's divisions.

  Any element inside `scope` that carries data-seat="slug slug" is shown only when
  the chosen seat is among its slugs; an element with data-seat="" (no seat
  recorded, or elected at large) is hidden while a seat is chosen. A list marked
  data-seat-list="k" shows the scope's data-seat-empty="k" line when nothing in it is left.

  Seat boundaries are not held (decision 1 of the proposal), so the control filters
  the lists and the map stays as it is; the line under the buttons says so.

    seats   the seat place records, in order
    scope   the id of the element whose lists are filtered
    noun    what a seat is called, plural ("trustee areas")
#}
{% if seats|length > 1 %}
<div class="seat-pick" role="group" aria-label="Show one {{ noun|trim('s', 'right') }}" data-seat-scope="{{ scope }}">
  <button type="button" data-seat-btn="" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
  {% for s in seats %}
    <button type="button" data-seat-btn="{{ s.slug }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ s.title|split(', ')|last|replace({ 'Trustee Area': 'Area', 'Council District': 'District' }) }}</button>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{#- Seats no member has yet been elected from: the City's Districts 2, 4 and 5 until November 2026, whose members sit at large
    until then (Ordinance 23-4; Nathan, 4 October 2026: "show what is actually there"). Each seat's record says why. -#}
{% set unheld = seats|filter(s => not craft.entries().section('officeHoldings').relatedTo({ targetElement: s, field: 'holdingDistrict' }).exists()) %}
<p class="seat-note">Choosing one shows it on the map and filters the board, past members and elections to that seat. Boundaries from the Los Angeles County Registrar-Recorder, for election purposes, not legal boundaries.{% if unheld|length %} No member has yet been elected from {% for s in unheld %}<a href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.title|split(', ')|last }}</a>{{ loop.revindex == 2 ? ' or ' : (not loop.last ? ', ' : '') }}{% endfor %}; {{ unheld|length == 1 ? 'its record says' : 'each one\'s record says' }} when its first election is.{% endif %}</p>
{% css %}
.seat-pick{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 8px}
.seat-pick button{border:1px solid rgba(23,37,76,.25);background:#fff;color:#17254C;padding:6px 13px;border-radius:14px;font-size:13.5px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif}
.seat-pick button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:#17254C;color:#fff;border-color:#17254C}
.seat-note{font-size:13.5px;color:#5B6472;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 26px;max-width:720px}
[data-seat-empty]{display:none;font-size:14px;color:#5B6472;margin:0 0 20px}
{% endcss %}
{% js %}
(function(){
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-seat-scope]').forEach(function(pick){
    var scope = document.getElementById(pick.getAttribute('data-seat-scope'));
    if (!scope) { return; }
    function show(seat){
      /* The map listens for this (_partials/civic/body-map), and the page keeps the seat in its address. */
      document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('scv:seat', { detail: { seat: seat, scope: scope.id } }));
      try { var u = new URL(location.href); if (seat) { u.searchParams.set('seat', seat); } else { u.searchParams.delete('seat'); } history.replaceState(null, '', u); } catch (e) {}
      pick.querySelectorAll('[data-seat-btn]').forEach(function(b){ b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', b.getAttribute('data-seat-btn') === seat ? 'true' : 'false'); });
      scope.querySelectorAll('[data-seat]').forEach(function(el){
        var on = !seat || (' ' + el.getAttribute('data-seat') + ' ').indexOf(' ' + seat + ' ') > -1;
        el.style.display = on ? '' : 'none';
      });
      scope.querySelectorAll('[data-seat-list]').forEach(function(list){
        var left = Array.prototype.filter.call(list.querySelectorAll('[data-seat]'), function(el){ return el.style.display !== 'none'; }).length;
        var empty = scope.querySelector('[data-seat-empty="' + list.getAttribute('data-seat-list') + '"]');
        if (empty) { empty.style.display = left ? 'none' : 'block'; }
      });
    }
    pick.querySelectorAll('[data-seat-btn]').forEach(function(b){ b.addEventListener('click', function(){ show(b.getAttribute('data-seat-btn')); }); });
    var start = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('seat');
    if (start && pick.querySelector('[data-seat-btn="' + start + '"]')) { show(start); }
  });
})();
{% endjs %}
{% endif %}
